  "body_markdown": "Hackensack, NJ\n\nAbout\n\nAbout UsDr. Alan MeskinDr. Maurice SrourDr. Won-Sang LeeDr. Dmitriy KlassOur TechnologyOffice Gallery\n\nServices\n\nAll ServicesDental ImplantsSingle Tooth ImplantsAll-On-XSmile MakeoversFull Mouth RehabilitationImplant BridgeImplant RevisionEmergency Dental ServicesSedation DentistryCost of Dental ImplantsDental Implant FAQs\n\nPatient Stories\n\nPatient TestimonialsBefore & After\n\nNew Patient\n\nYour First VisitInsurance & FinancingDental Implant FAQsPre Op & Post Op InstructionsBlogs\n\nDoctor Referral\n\nContact\n\nSchedule Your Consultation\n\nSCHEDULE FREE CONSULTATION\n\nSchedule Consultation\n\n\n# Our Smile Gallery\n\n\nBefore & after results\n\nBefore\n\nAfter\n\n‹›\n\nActual patients of Hackensack Center for Dental Implants, photographed before and after treatment and published with written consent. Every case is different; individual results vary.\n\n\n### Reimagine your dental experience\n\n\n\n### address\n\n\n163 Main Street, Suite A1,\n\nHackensack, NJ 07601\n\n(551) 368-2476\n\n\n### Hours\n\n\nMonday - Friday: 10:00 AM to 6:00 PM\n\nSaturday - Sunday: Closed\n\n\n### LANGUAGES\n\n\nEnglish\n\nEspañol\n\nРусский\n\nPortuguese\n\nKorean\n\nServing Hackensack and the Greater Bergen County Area\n\nCopyright © 2026 Hackensack Center for Dental Implants\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nTerms of Service\n\nCookie Policy\n\nHIPAA Disclosure",
